{"assets":["/statement-assets/1facf3928b6e5fbe3ded4f09283300fc6741dea77476cddd0c90f22e13bf6ee4.webp","/statement-assets/118b7467c7316887f1d0677d501e449543f93d336fbb7b6bee498a5386594a4a.png","/statement-assets/0cf8f0e8ece0d38264099ad1649cea3565581da1336c0c6dd4205cc2fc04b44e.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1337","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Ichihime and Triangle"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Ichihime is the current priestess of the Mahjong Soul Temple. She claims to be human, despite her cat ears."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"These days the temple is holding a math contest. Usually, Ichihime lacks interest in these things, but this time the prize for the winner is her favorite — cookies. Ichihime decides to attend the contest. Now she is solving the following problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/1facf3928b6e5fbe3ded4f09283300fc6741dea77476cddd0c90f22e13bf6ee4.webp"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given four positive integers $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$, $$$d$$$, such that $$$a \\leq b \\leq c \\leq d$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to find three integers $$$x$$$, $$$y$$$, $$$z$$$, satisfying the following conditions:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a \\leq x \\leq b$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b \\leq y \\leq c$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$c \\leq z \\leq d$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" There exists a triangle with a positive non-zero area and the lengths of its three sides are $$$x$$$, $$$y$$$, and $$$z$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Ichihime desires to get the cookie, but the problem seems too hard for her. Can you help her?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 1000$$$)  — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next $$$t$$$ lines describe test cases. Each test case is given as four space-separated integers $$$a$$$, $$$b$$$, $$$c$$$, $$$d$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a \\leq b \\leq c \\leq d \\leq 10^9$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print three integers $$$x$$$, $$$y$$$, $$$z$$$  — the integers you found satisfying the conditions given in the statement."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the answer always exists. If there are multiple answers, print any."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n1 3 5 7\n1 5 5 7\n100000 200000 300000 400000\n1 1 977539810 977539810\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3 4 5\n5 5 5\n182690 214748 300999\n1 977539810 977539810\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One of the possible solutions to the first test case:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/118b7467c7316887f1d0677d501e449543f93d336fbb7b6bee498a5386594a4a.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One of the possible solutions to the second test case:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/0cf8f0e8ece0d38264099ad1649cea3565581da1336c0c6dd4205cc2fc04b44e.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1337A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1337/problem/A"}